Modifications for Dell Pro (this fork)
--------------------------------------
Copyright (C) 2026 D-Helper contributors

Changes relative to upstream G-Helper include, among others:
- Retarget to .NET 8 (net8.0-windows) for wider runtime availability
- Dell Optimizer (do-cli) and Dell Command | Configure (cctk) hardware bridge
  when ASUS ATKACPI is unavailable (AsusACPI Dell-bridged mode)
- Performance mode mapping for Dell thermal profiles (Quiet / Optimized / Cool / Ultra)
- Battery charge limit and Fn-Lock via CCTK / Optimizer
- UI gating: hide ASUS-only GPU MUX, Aura, Anime Matrix, Ally, peripherals, fan curves / PPT
- Updates UI redirected to Dell Support catalog links for Dell Pro 16 PC16250
- Branding as D-Helper (assembly name DHelper); config under %AppData%\DHelper

